cff-version: 1.2.0
title: parquet-arrow-java
abstract: >-
  parquet-arrow-java is a pure-JVM, Hadoop-free bidirectional bridge between
  in-memory Apache Arrow and standard Apache Parquet. It writes an Arrow
  VectorSchemaRoot to a standard Parquet file and reads Parquet back into
  reusable Arrow vectors, without requiring an Apache Hadoop dependency in the
  consumer's runtime.
type: software
version: 0.1.1
url: "https://github.com/mprammer/parquet-arrow-java"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mprammer/parquet-arrow-java"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
