    family-names: Prammer
    email: "parquet-arrow@spiraldb.com"
    affiliation: Spiral
keywords:
  - parquet
  - arrow
  - jvm
  - hadoop-free
  - columnar
message: >-
  If you use parquet-arrow-java in academic work, please cite it using the metadata
  in this file.
